            <div xml:id="d553">

                <pb facs="0827" n="725" sameAs="frus:frus1933v01/pg725"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">550.S1 Economic Commission/53: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State
                        to the Chairman of the American Delegation</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Hull</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1933-07-19T17:00:00-04:00">July 19, 1933—5
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>160. Your 149, July 19, 1 a.m. The President authorizes you to make a formal
                    statement along the lines suggested.</p>
                <p>The British limitation of home-grown sugar is satisfactory, provided that after
                    the first 2 years the permitted increase will be the same as that allowed for
                    the United States.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Phillips</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
